{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT OR DIE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/16a5a15ce617e7ce6a660e235761ce48.poster.avif?t=1758988445\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/16a5a15ce617e7ce6a660e235761ce48.webm?t=1758988445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/16a5a15ce617e7ce6a660e235761ce48.mp4?t=1758988445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Arena Fighter is a survival game based on combat.. FPS genre. We are fighting against the invasion of creatures of unknown origin with characters with unique powers in the arenas where many warriors fought!.. Some creatures run faster, some run slower, but if caught, it hurts a lot, but does the warrior have advantages?.. Of course!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/f4c47b56f2438e97fb3f6f4c038b9c6e.poster.avif?t=1758988445\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/f4c47b56f2438e97fb3f6f4c038b9c6e.webm?t=1758988445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/f4c47b56f2438e97fb3f6f4c038b9c6e.mp4?t=1758988445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also important to stay away when fighting creatures..nobody wants to throw themselves into the fire!?\u00a0The arenas are quite spacious for the player to easily perform escape actions, but they change as the enemy increases!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've taken too many hits from creatures and are even thinking about dying, don't worry! There are Health Items in the Arena that can help your Warrior get back on their feet, even if only a little.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Warriors have a super attack alongside their weapons. This varies from fighter to fighter. Some fighters use super powers for evasion, while others use more brutal attacks!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Aim</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a beginner warrior... Not all warriors are available to play for you, you have a level and in this level you pass a level by resisting and killing the damn zombies and you go to the next level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023480?t=1758988445","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023480?t=1758988445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/095b10d122a5a52bbb522b8ad66cf49bdda9e4d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758988445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/095b10d122a5a52bbb522b8ad66cf49bdda9e4d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758988445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT OR DIE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/16a5a15ce617e7ce6a660e235761ce48.poster.avif?t=1758988445\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/16a5a15ce617e7ce6a660e235761ce48.webm?t=1758988445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/16a5a15ce617e7ce6a660e235761ce48.mp4?t=1758988445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Arena Fighter is a survival game based on combat.. FPS genre. We are fighting against the invasion of creatures of unknown origin with characters with unique powers in the arenas where many warriors fought!.. Some creatures run faster, some run slower, but if caught, it hurts a lot, but does the warrior have advantages?.. Of course!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/f4c47b56f2438e97fb3f6f4c038b9c6e.poster.avif?t=1758988445\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/f4c47b56f2438e97fb3f6f4c038b9c6e.webm?t=1758988445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/extras/f4c47b56f2438e97fb3f6f4c038b9c6e.mp4?t=1758988445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also important to stay away when fighting creatures..nobody wants to throw themselves into the fire!?\u00a0The arenas are quite spacious for the player to easily perform escape actions, but they change as the enemy increases!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've taken too many hits from creatures and are even thinking about dying, don't worry! There are Health Items in the Arena that can help your Warrior get back on their feet, even if only a little.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Warriors have a super attack alongside their weapons. This varies from fighter to fighter. Some fighters use super powers for evasion, while others use more brutal attacks!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Aim</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a beginner warrior... Not all warriors are available to play for you, you have a level and in this level you pass a level by resisting and killing the damn zombies and you go to the next level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Taha Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023480/5ecff39afdf4e1603060c949d3ae79925de7f8bb/header.jpg?t=1758988445","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4023480/900429525/82bb76b01d5d76d7f4550f092734e18b03b1295d/1757501883/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758728697","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4023480/900429525/82bb76b01d5d76d7f4550f092734e18b03b1295d/1757501883/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758728697","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4023480/900429525/82bb76b01d5d76d7f4550f092734e18b03b1295d/1757501883/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758728697","id":257195581,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195581/movie480.mp4?t=1758728697","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195581/movie_max.mp4?t=1758728697"},"name":"Arena Fighter..","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195581/cf701f1b3730325dd25df40f2e8b750faf90b4cc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758728697","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195581/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758728697","max":"https://vi